er2%23lem%3Aopens-restrict-differential\">↗ lem:opens-restrict-differential</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Aopens-inclusion-differential\">↗ lem:opens-inclusion-differential</a> \\sketch The open-submanifold inclusion has identity differential. Proposition <a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FappendixA%23prop%3Aregular-level-set-tangent-kernel\" data-tex-node=\"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/appendixA#prop:regular-level-set-tangent-kernel\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-70726f703a726567756c61722d6c6576656c2d7365742d74616e67656e742d6b65726e656c\">prop:regular-level-set-tangent-kernel</a> identifies the image in <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$T_x\\mathcal R$\">$T_x\\mathcal R$</span> with <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\ker d(f|_{\\mathcal R})_x$\">$\\ker d(f|_{\\mathcal R})_x$</span>, and Lemma <a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Aopens-restrict-differential\" data-tex-node=\"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:opens-restrict-differential\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-6c656d3a6f70656e732d72657374726963742d646966666572656e7469616c\">5</a> identifies this kernel with <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\ker df_x$\">$\\ker df_x$</span>. </p><span class=\"qed\" aria-label=\"证毕\" style=\"display:block;text-align:right\">□</span></section>","warnings":["部分 TeX 排版细节未完整还原（已保留可读内容）: sketch"]},"previous":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:regular-part-inclusion-immersion","next":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:gradient-normal-regular-part","relations":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:regular-level-set-hypersurface","title":"pro